act — no collection logic is re-implemented in the Dashboard.\n\n## HLR Traceability\n\n- HLR-1 (P0): per-project GPU-hour consumption reports over selectable time\n  ranges.\n- HLR-2 (P1, bundled with HLR-1): CSV export and stable API are retrieval\n  modes of the same report surface and data.\n- HLR-3 (P1, view side): current-month consumption against each project's\n  Kueue quota in the Dashboard admin view.\n\n## Risks / Notes\n\n- External timing risk: this work is gated on the finalized metering data\n  schema from the in-flight GPU usage metering strategy (RHAISTRAT-9990); if\n  the finalized schema does not support the reporting needs, the\n  implementation is rewritten against the actual schema shape (or extensions\n  are requested to the metering strategy) before proceeding.\n"}}],"model":"rits/zai-org/glm-5-3","stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":48097,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"chatcmpl-tool-ad32f63ef3803cbc","agent_id":"aa2535d4b490cc539","session_id":"ae63a1c3-308e-4096-a1af-f3bfa0f3fcf1","uuid":"8bd7040d-8b06-4fe8-a57d-c48d326be4ca","timestamp":"2026-10-23T18:04:01.656Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Decompose RHAISTRAT-9018"}
